    "One coarse weather lookup at each start flavours sound and image. Each influence has its own intensity — mix it in or out. The body stays the main driver." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-7, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of EchoelStudioView, the instrument — localised by content, no Sources change.",
