    "Target IP + port per output — changes apply immediately while the output is running. OSC/ADM default to 'localhost' (this device); for Resolume · TouchDesigner · MadMapper enter the target computer's IP. Art-Net and sACN send unicast to the node IP you enter (default 192.168.1.100) — the app holds no broadcast entitlement, so 255.255.255.255 reaches nothing on iOS." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-8, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of the Routing surface (PatchbayView) and the effects panel (EchoelFXView) — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Target IP + port per output — changes apply immediately while the output is running. OSC/ADM default to 'localhost' (this device); for Resolume · TouchDesigner · MadMapper enter the target computer's IP. Art-Net and sACN send unicast to the node IP you enter (default 192.168.1.100) — the app holds no broadcast entitlement, so 255.255.255.255 reaches nothing on iOS."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ziel-IP + Port je Ausgang — Änderungen gelten sofort, während der Ausgang läuft. OSC/ADM stehen standardmäßig auf 'localhost' (dieses Gerät); für Resolume · TouchDesigner · MadMapper die IP des Zielrechners eintragen. Art-Net und sACN senden Unicast an die eingetragene Node-IP (Standard 192.168.1.100) — die App hat keine Broadcast-Berechtigung, 255.255.255.255 erreicht auf iOS nichts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
