    "Shows the piece's scenes to launch on the bar, and Mute and Solo for its tracks. While the Echoel plays on its own, stop it in the header to launch a scene." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeigt die Szenen des Stücks zum Starten am Takt sowie Mute und Solo für seine Spuren. Spielt das Echoel allein, stoppe es im Kopf, um eine Szene zu starten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows the piece's scenes to launch on the bar, and Mute and Solo for its tracks. While the Echoel plays on its own, stop it in the header to launch a scene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to launch yet. Parts you write in Compose, and the Echoel's generated music, appear here as scenes to launch on the bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noch nichts zu starten. Teile, die du in Komponieren schreibst, und die generierte Musik des Echoel erscheinen hier als Szenen zum Starten am Takt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing to launch yet. Parts you write in Compose, and the Echoel's generated music, appear here as scenes to launch on the bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Echoel is playing. Stop it in the header to launch a scene — the piece then starts on the scene's bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Echoel spielt. Stoppe es im Kopf, um eine Szene zu starten — das Stück beginnt dann am Takt der Szene."
